><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">http://www.sec.gov</div></div> that contains this information. </div><div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0px;">&#160;</div><div style="text-align:center;text-indent: 0px;"><div style="line-height: 6pt; margin: 0px auto; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 21%; text-align: center;">&#160;</div></div><div style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 9pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;"><div style="null;text-indent: 0px;font-weight:bold;display:inline;">The date of this prospectus is June 12, 2024 </div></div><div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0px;">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always;text-indent: 0px;"></div><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;text-indent: 0px;"/><div id="rom832714_1" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;"><div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;">SUITABILITY STANDARDS </div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Common Shares offered through this prospectus are suitable only as a long-term investment for persons of adequate financial means such that they do not have a need for liquidity in this investment. We have established financial suitability standards for initial shareholders in this offering which require that a purchaser of shares have either: </div><div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0px;">&#160;</div>
