ith PIK interest and <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">zero-coupon</div> securities), accrued income that we have not yet received in cash. <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Pre-Incentive</div> Fee Net Investment Income Returns do not include any realized capital gains, realized capital losses or unrealized capital appreciation or depreciation. The impact of expense support payments and recoupments are also excluded from <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Pre-Incentive</div> Fee Net Investment Income Returns. </div><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
