nto account its obligations under ERISA, and applicable similar laws, and the facts and circumstances of each investing Plan. </div><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Prospective investors should carefully review the matters discussed under &#8220;Risk Factors&#8221; and &#8220;Restrictions on Share Ownership&#8221; and should consult with their own advisors as to the consequences of making an investment in the Fund. </div><div style="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
