<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left; line-height: normal;"><ix:nonNumeric name="cef:ManagementFeeNotBasedOnNetAssetsNoteTextBlock" contextRef="P06_12_2024To06_12_2024" escape="true" id="ixv-201572">The base management fee paid to our Adviser is calculated at an annual rate of 1.25% of the value of our net assets as of the beginning of the first calendar day of the applicable month.</ix:nonNumeric> </div></td></tr></table>
