om sources other than cash flow from operating activities. We will cease paying the shareholder servicing and/or distribution fee on the Class&#160;S shares, Class&#160;D shares and Class&#160;F shares on the earlier to occur of the following: (i)&#160;a listing of Class&#160;I shares, (ii)&#160;our merger or consolidation with or into another entity, or the </div></div></div> </td> </tr> </table> <div style="clear:both;max-height:0pt;text-indent: 0px;"></div> <div style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 8pt;text-indent: 0px;">&#160;</div> <div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center;text-indent: 0px;">82 </div> <div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always;text-indent: 0px;"></div> <hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;text-indent: 0px;"/>
