<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">Source: Preqin, Preqin Special Report: The Future of Alternatives in 2028. </div></td></tr></table>
