ideration of such nominees or proposals might be harmful or beneficial to us and our shareholders. </div> <div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Our Adviser or our Board, as applicable, may not, without the approval of a vote by the holders of more than 50% of the outstanding shares entitled to vote on such matters: </div> <div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0px;">&#160;</div>
