yle="font-weight:bold;display:inline;">data subject</div></div>&#8221;, &#8220;<div style="letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;">personal data</div></div>&#8221; and &#8220;<div style="letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;">processing</div></div>&#8221; in this Data Privacy Notice shall be interpreted in accordance with the applicable EU and UK Data Protection Legislation. </div><div style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;text-indent: 0px;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">We are sensitive to the privacy concerns of the individual investors, and individuals associated with institutional investors, in the Fund or an account. We have a policy of protecting the confidentiality and security of information we collect about you. We are providing you this Data Privacy Notice to help you better understand why and how we collect certain personal data, the care with which we treat that personal data, and how we use that personal data. </div></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;text-indent: 0px;"><div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"><div style="font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Categories and sources of personal data collected </div></div></div></div><div style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;text-indent: 0px;">In connection with forming, operating and advising the Fund and accounts for our investors, HPS Investment Partners, LLC, HPS Investment Partners (UK) LLP, HPS Investment Partners Lux S&#224;rl, HPS Investment Partners (HK), Limited, HPS Investment Partners (SG) Pte. Ltd. and HPS Investment Partners (AUS) Pty Ltd. 